🔹 HTML
🔹 html-languageserver

    Pros:

        Offers features like autocompletion, validation, and formatting.

        Supports modern HTML standards and frameworks.

    Cons:

        Limited support for complex templating engines.

        Performance can degrade with large files.

🔹 SQL
🔹 sqls

    Pros:

        Lightweight and fast with support for multiple SQL dialects.

        Provides features like autocompletion and linting.

    Cons:

        Limited support for advanced SQL features.

